# Local Elin references. Nothing under lib/ is ever committed: it holds game
# assemblies, BepInEx, and unpacked third-party mod packages, none of which are
# ours to redistribute. Ignore the whole directory rather than naming subfolders,
# because the next thing dropped in there will not match a name listed here.
lib/

